7. Pending Tasks:
   - **CRITICAL/UNRESOLVED**: Figure out how to visualize cheek cells without any liquids (no methylene blue, no wet mounts) — needs alternative approach for real-time cell detection from a judge's sample
   - Repo reorganization: Move React app into `ui/`, Python backend into `backend/`, push to GitHub (user said "also better organize that shi" — not done yet, needs approval)
   - Update README and documentation (user: "also update the readme and further documentation once I approve the UI changes" — UI changes were approved but docs not updated)
   - Wire real Hailo-10H inference into the WebSocket pipeline (currently MockAIService)
